<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:lang="lzh"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>瘋人院擊斃華人</title><title type="alternate">Feng ren yuan ji bi Hua ren [Death of a Chinese Patient at a Mental Institution]</title><author>無署名（《東華報》）</author><respStmt><resp>整理與編碼</resp><name>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu)</name></respStmt></titleStmt><editionStmt><edition>Transcription dataset v0.1.0</edition></editionStmt><publicationStmt><p>曲宸宇 (Chu, Chen-Yu). Dataset edition 0.1.0.</p></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>東華報</title><date when="1928-06-23">1928-06-23</date><idno>Tung Wah Times, 1928-06-23, p. 8, NLA news-page24098856</idno><ref target="https://trove.nla.gov.au/newspaper/page/24098856">澳洲國家圖書館 Trove</ref></bibl></sourceDesc></fileDesc></teiHeader><facsimile><surface n="8" xml:id="original-page"><graphic url="https://trove.nla.gov.au/ndp/imageservice/nla.news-page24098856/level5" /></surface></facsimile><text><body><div type="article"><pb n="8" facs="#original-page" /><head>瘋人院擊斃華人</head><p><lb n="single-1" />本月十五號。　本省高爐彬埠消息云<lb n="single-2" />。。有一華人差厘勝。在高爐彬埠瘋<lb n="single-3" />人院多年　於本月十五號入沐浴房<lb n="single-4" />。。忽被同院西人。。用舊掃地器具之<lb n="single-5" />柄擊傷。。未幾即斃命。。查該華人初<lb n="single-6" />入苛倫柏醫院。。一九二十年移住高<lb n="single-7" />爐彬埠瘋人院者。。兇手係同院同病<lb n="single-8" />者。。在該院亦有數年云。</p></div></body></text></TEI>